    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_fixed_stream_array" kindref="compound">FixedStreamArray</ref> is similar to <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_var_stream_array" kindref="compound">VarStreamArray</ref>, except with each record having a fixed-length. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>As with <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_var_stream_array" kindref="compound">VarStreamArray</ref>, there is no upfront cost associated with building or copying a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_fixed_stream_array" kindref="compound">FixedStreamArray</ref>, as the memory for each element is not read from the backing stream until that element is iterated. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
